dist-realhost/
# Live Test-feature run screenshots (e2e/test_feature_live.py) — evidence, not source; the
# captured plans + report.json beside them ARE committed. The launch reservation (flock) file and
# in-flight report temp files are process state, never evidence.
e2e/artifacts/**/*.png
# …except the 21 historical screenshots of the three recorded live runs (LT-1/2/3, 2026-09-09):
# observations of runs that cannot be regenerated — committed as evidence and linked from
# docs/testing/test-feature-live-report.md. Regenerated runs anywhere else stay ignored.
!e2e/artifacts/test-feature-live/LT-*.png
# Every harness invocation writes its own e2e/artifacts/test-feature-live/runs/<UTC>-<pid>/ (report.json,
# plans, screenshots) — scratch until `--promote <run-dir>` copies one into the root deliberately.
e2e/artifacts/test-feature-live/runs/
e2e/artifacts/**/.launch.lock
e2e/artifacts/**/.*.tmp

# Per-checkout code graph an older wicked-core indexed in-tree (#220). The live graph is built by
# `wicked-estate index` under the daemon state home (wicked-core#406); nothing here is source.
.codegraph/
